{"unit_id":"DDDMUC__dsh-session-relocate#card-zh","repo":"DDDMUC/dsh-session-relocate","commit":"f1dde2846b3e2ddb981f4f3e206ec7cbf72ec65e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-relocate 是面向 DSH 网页端的会话工作区迁移插件。它在会话侧栏菜单和拖放交互中提供迁移入口，并通过主机桥接接口更新会话日志与工作区归属。用户可以将单条或多条会话移到已有工作区，也可输入目录路径创建并登记新工作区；还可在会话页面通过工作区入口发起迁移。实现包含迁移事务、压缩日志头部改写和待完成迁移恢复，适合整理项目会话与调整工作区归属。安装后需要重启 DSH web，无需额外账号或 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.js:154-180","src/plugin.js:943-980","src/relocate.js:372-429","src/relocate.js:746-753","lib/client.js:519-550"]}
{"unit_id":"DDDMUC__dsh-session-relocate#card-en","repo":"DDDMUC/dsh-session-relocate","commit":"f1dde2846b3e2ddb981f4f3e206ec7cbf72ec65e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-relocate moves DSH conversations between workspaces from the web sidebar. Choose a target from the menu, drag a conversation, or move several at once. It updates session files and workspace ownership, and can register a directory as a workspace. Install in DSH web and restart the host.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.js:154-180","src/plugin.js:943-980","src/relocate.js:372-429","src/relocate.js:746-753","lib/client.js:519-550"]}
